    "text": "An original space opera setting: an old crown, a league of merchant republics and a syndicate in the shadows, joined by starlane drives that are a setting rule, not physics (marked fictional).",
    "fictional": true,
    "note": "Written for SSE4 (tags design TG13). Rules and plain descriptions only; no published setting is copied."
   },
